@page
@model PlanKryptoWeb.Pages.RoadmapModel

<section class="page">
    <h1>Roadmap</h1>
    <p class="lead">
        PlanKrypto is being built in stages, starting with a powerful monitoring tool
        and expanding into DeFi and full asset tokenization.
    </p>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>Phase 1 – Core Platform</h2>
        <p>Status: <strong>Live / Ongoing</strong></p>
        <ul class="list">
            <li><strong>Basic Price Tracker</strong> – Real-time prices for selected cryptocurrencies.</li>
            <li><strong>Alert System</strong> – Custom alerts when a coin hits a target price.</li>
            <li><strong>User Interface</strong> – Clean UI for selecting coins, watchlists, and alerts.</li>
            <li><strong>Portfolio Tracking</strong> – Performance, gains/losses, and allocation.</li>
            <li><strong>Advanced Alerts</strong> – Percentage moves, volume spikes, and event/news triggers (planned).</li>
            <li><strong>Market Analysis Tools</strong> – Charts, moving averages, RSI, and indicators (planned).</li>
            <li><strong>Educational Resources</strong> – Basics of crypto, charts, and strategies (planned).</li>
            <li><strong>Community Features</strong> – User discussions and strategy sharing (planned).</li>
            <li><strong>Mobile Apps</strong> – iOS and Android versions.</li>
            <li><strong>AI Modules (TBD)</strong> – Analysis, risk alerts, and idea generation.</li>
            <li><strong>Monetization &amp; Partnerships</strong> – Premium analytics and exchange integrations.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt">
        <h2>Stage 2 – DeFi Integration</h2>
        <p>Status: <strong>Next</strong></p>
        <ul class="list">
            <li><strong>Staking</strong> – Yield on supported assets via audited smart contracts.</li>
            <li><strong>Lending &amp; Borrowing</strong> – On-chain loans and lending pools, possibly via existing protocols.</li>
            <li><strong>On-Chain Risk Dashboard</strong> – Health factors, collateral ratios, liquidation risk.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
        <h2>Stage 3 – Asset Tokenization</h2>
        <p>Status: <strong>Future Vision</strong></p>
        <ul class="list">
            <li><strong>Tokenized “Stock”</strong> – Companies convert equity into blockchain-based tokens.</li>
            <li><strong>Market Access</strong> – Trade these tokens through PlanKrypto-connected markets.</li>
            <li><strong>Streamlined Capital Raising</strong> – Crypto-native alternative to traditional IPOs.</li>
            <li><strong>Broader Asset Tokenization</strong> – Other asset classes as regulation and infra allow.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-alt timeline">
        <h2>Timeline Overview</h2>
        <div class="timeline-row">
            <div class="timeline-step">
                <div class="dot dot-active"></div>
                <div>Phase 1<br />Core Platform<br />Live / Ongoing</div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-step">
                <div class="dot dot-next"></div>
                <div>Stage 2<br />DeFi Integration<br />Next</div>
            </div>
            <div class="timeline-step">
                <div class="dot"></div>
                <div>Stage 3<br />Tokenization<br />Future</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</section>
